Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.10,0:03:25.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fnVAGRounded BT\fs46\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(269,335)}Has Myulla been sleeping soundly at night?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.10,0:03:25.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fnVAGRounded BT\fs46\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(346,486)}Mash, I know playing knights is fun
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.10,0:03:25.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fnVAGRounded BT\fs46\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(346,626)}but are you keeping up with your studies?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.10,0:03:25.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fnVAGRounded BT\fs46\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(346,788)}Dad, make sure you go easy on the booze.
